      "content": "Collapsing newlines and surrounding whitespace loses meaningful title content. A backtick title containing `first\\n    second` (an actual newline) and the single-line title `first second` produce identical output, so changing one to the other passes the inventory comparison even though the title changed. Encode newlines and whitespace losslessly while retaining one output line per title, and add a fixture verifying that multiline and single-line titles remain distinguishable.",
